.DS_Store

# Build outputs, at any depth.
#
# Deliberately not anchored to the root. `/build` matches only the top-level directory, so
# every module's own `build/` slipped past it: 2,112 files of dex, jars, class files and
# intermediates were committed, and each `git add -A` re-committed tens of megabytes more.
build/

/captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
local.properties
*.apk
*.aab

# Signing material. A keystore is a credential: committing one hands out the ability to sign as
# this app, and it cannot be rotated afterwards without a new package name.
*.keystore
*.jks
!debug.keystore

# The vendored 3D-terrain MapLibre SDK is committed (see README, "3D terrain"); it is
# refreshed, not dropped in. Its build outputs are covered by the rule above.
